---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Contact Buy Better Finds"
  description="Contact Buy Better Finds with questions, corrections, product suggestions, or business inquiries."
>
  <article class="article">
    <div class="eyebrow">Contact</div>
    <h1>Get in touch.</h1>
    <p class="lead">Have a question about a product, notice an outdated detail, or want to suggest a product for consideration? We welcome feedback.</p>

    <h2>Product corrections</h2>
    <p>If you notice an incorrect price, specification, product link, or other detail, please let us know so we can review and update the information.</p>

    <h2>Product suggestions</h2>
    <p>We are building a growing catalog of practical product recommendations. Product suggestions are welcome and may be considered for future research.</p>

    <h2>Business inquiries</h2>
    <p>For business, partnership, advertising, or affiliate-related inquiries, please contact us at <a href="mailto:info@buybetterfinds.com">info@buybetterfinds.com</a>.</p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Email: <a href="mailto:info@buybetterfinds.com">info@buybetterfinds.com</a></p>

    <div class="card" style="margin-top:2rem;">
      <h3>Before you purchase</h3>
      <p>Prices, availability, shipping, specifications, and return policies can change. Always confirm the current information directly with the retailer before completing a purchase.</p>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
